  * stock ones from Samsung's ss_dsi_panel_S6E3HAD_AMF670ZA01_FHD panel device
- * tree (fhd120hs timing, its default), with the edits Samsung's panel code
- * (ss_dsi_panel_S6E3HAD_AMF670ZA01.c) makes to them for 120HS.
+ * tree (fhd120hs, fhd96hs, fhd60hs, fhd60ns and fhd48hs timings), with the
+ * edits Samsung's panel code (ss_dsi_panel_S6E3HAD_AMF670ZA01.c) makes to them,
+ * including the gamma it computes for 96 and 48 Hz from the panel's flash.
  *
  * Copyright (C) 2026 Noa Himesaka <himesaka@noa.codes>
